0e%20queria%20entender%20como%20os%20agentes%20podem%20ajudar%20o%20meu%20neg%C3%B3cio" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Hire Fin<span class="_arrow_c0i59_69" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"><path d="M3 9h11M10 4.5L14.5 9 10 13.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span></a></div></div><div class="_visual_1hiwg_41"><div class="_card_1hiwg_46"><img src="/assets/fin-dashboard-en-DxvO4BhC.png" alt="Painel de Fluxo de caixa do Squad conduzido pelo Fin" class="_dashboard_1hiwg_58"/><img src="/assets/fin-dashboard-mobile-en-DOmd5qqn.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="_dashboardMobile_1hiwg_74"/></div><span class="_characterShadow_1hiwg_89" aria-hidden="true"></span><img src="/assets/fin-character-mbRNdaHb.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="_character_1hiwg_89"/></div></section><section class="_section_421yr_1" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><ul class="_grid_421yr_7"><li class="_card_421yr_14"><img src="/assets/fin-hl-1-en-x4k5NTS9.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="_illus_421yr_71"/><p class="_caption_421yr_78">Gathers every payment in your business in one place.</p></li><li class="_card_421yr_14"><img src="/assets/fin-hl-2-en-TXi1Jc90.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="_illus_421yr_71"/><p class="_caption_421yr_78">Organizes collection and generates a payment link.</p></li><li class="_card_421yr_14"><img src="/assets/fin-hl-3-en-DscCblfp.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="_illus_421yr_71"/><p class="_caption_421yr_78">Shows what’s really left at the end of the month.</p></li><li class="_card_421yr_14"><img src="/assets/fin-hl-4-en-DWub0c_c.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="_illus_421yr_71"/><p class="_caption_421yr_78">Forecasts next month’s cash.</p></li></ul></section><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><section class="_section_11a56_1 "><div class="_text_11a56_30"><p class="_eyebrow_11a56_39" style="background-image:linear-gradient(90deg, #0091ff, #7ec4f2)">CASH FLOW</p><h2 class="_title_11a56_51">Know what’s left,
without opening a spreadsheet</h2><p class="_paragraph_11a56_61">Fin centralizes all your business’s payments and shows how much comes in, how much goes out, and what’s really left. It also forecasts cash for the coming months, so you can plan purchases and growth with more confidence.</p><button type="button" class="_cta_11a56_69 ">Learn more<span class="_arrow_11a56_105" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"><path d="M3 9h11M10 4.5L14.5 9 10 13.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="_visual_11a56_126"><img src="/assets/fin-sec1-en-Dg5IhUND.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="_image_11a56_133"/></div></section></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="_divider_11a56_12" aria-hidden="true"></div><section class="_section_11a56_1 _reverse_11a56_25"><div class="_text_11a56_30"><p class="_eyebrow_11a56_39" style="background-image:linear-gradient(90deg, #0091ff, #7ec4f2)">INVOICE ISSUING</p><h2 class="_title_11a56_51">Less bureaucracy,
less room for error</h2><p class="_paragraph_11a56_61">Fin issues invoices right in the platform, with no jumping to another system. The process becomes simpler and centralized, cutting the chance of error and keeping issuing integrated with the rest of your business’s finances.</p><button type="button" class="_cta_11a56_69 _ctaDisabled_11a56_91">Coming soon</button></div><div class="_visual_11a56_126"><img src="/assets/fin-sec2-en-CLoeUjjG.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="_image_11a56_133"/></div></section></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="_divider_11a56_12" aria-hidden="true"></div><section class="_section_11a56_1 "><div class="_text_11a56_30"><p class="_eyebrow_11a56_39" style="background-image:linear-gradient(90deg, #0091ff, #7ec4f2)">PAYMENT LINKS</p><h2 class="_title_11a56_51">Collection ready,
no card reader or separate system</h2><p class="_paragraph_11a56_61">Fin generates a payment link for any sale, with no need for a card reader or a separate system. The customer chooses Pix, card, or bank slip, and as soon as the payment lands, the status updates on its own.</p><button type="button" class="_cta_11a56_69 _ctaDisabled_11a56_91">Coming soon</button></div><div class="_visual_11a56_126"><img src="/assets/fin-sec3-en-BsOAs3jk.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="_image_11a56_133"/></div></section></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="_divider_11a56_12" aria-hidden="true"></div><section class="_section_11a56_1 _reverse_11a56_25"><div class="_text_11a56_30"><p class="_eyebrow_11a56_39" style="background-image:linear-gradient(90deg, #0091ff, #7ec4f2)">CUSTOMER COLLECTION</p><h2 class="_title_11a56_51">Collect on its own,
without writing a message</h2><p class="_paragraph_11a56_61">Fin sends the payment reminder on its own, before and after the due date, following the tone you set. Collection stays consistent, without sounding robotic or aggressive, and reduces the amount stuck in your cash flow.</p><button type="button" class="_cta_11a56_69 _ctaDisabled_11a56_91">Coming soon</button></div><div class="_visual_11a56_126"><img src="/assets/fin-sec4-en-Dg597unf.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="_image_11a56_133"/></div></section></div><section class="_section_vfnfj_1" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><h2 class="_title_vfnfj_11">What changes with <span class="_gradient_vfnfj_21">Fin</span><br/>on your team</h2><div class="_cards_vfnfj_28"><div class="_card_vfnfj_28"><p class="_cardLabel_vfnfj_46">WITHOUT FIN ON YOUR TEAM</p><div class="_row_vfnfj_55"><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20preserveAspectRatio=&#x27;none&#x27;%20width=&#x27;100%25&#x27;%20height=&#x27;100%25&#x27;%20overflow=&#x27;visible&#x27;%20style=&#x27;display:%20block;&#x27;%20viewBox=&#x27;0%200%2032%2032&#x27;%20fill=&#x27;none&#x27;%20xmlns=&#x27;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#x27;%3e%3cg%20id=&#x27;ThumbsDown&#x27;%3e%3cpath%20id=&#x27;Vector&#x27;%20d=&#x27;M24.8055%2017.3387L23.8605%209.77875C23.8029%209.32191%2023.5806%208.90179%2023.2352%208.59729C22.8898%208.29278%2022.4451%208.12484%2021.9847%208.125H8.43968C8.1055%208.125%207.78502%208.25775%207.54872%208.49405C7.31243%208.73034%207.17968%209.05083%207.17968%209.385V16.315C7.17968%2016.6492%207.31243%2016.9697%207.54872%2017.206C7.78502%2017.4423%208.1055%2017.575%208.43968%2017.575H11.8307L14.8058%2023.5269C14.8582%2023.6316%2014.9387%2023.7196%2015.0383%2023.7811C15.1379%2023.8426%2015.2526%2023.8751%2015.3697%2023.875C16.2051%2023.875%2017.0063%2023.5431%2017.5971%2022.9524C18.1878%2022.3616%2018.5197%2021.5604%2018.5197%2020.725V19.465H22.9297C23.1979%2019.4651%2023.463%2019.4081%2023.7075%2019.2978C23.952%2019.1875%2024.1702%2019.0265%202