145%2017.2598%2010.838%2017.2597%2011.275V13.165C17.2597%2013.3321%2017.3261%2013.4923%2017.4442%2013.6105C17.5624%2013.7286%2017.7226%2013.795%2017.8897%2013.795H22.9297C23.0191%2013.795%2023.1075%2013.814%2023.189%2013.8507C23.2705%2013.8875%2023.3432%2013.9412%2023.4023%2014.0082C23.4615%2014.0753%2023.5057%2014.1541%2023.532%2014.2396C23.5583%2014.325%2023.5661%2014.4151%2023.555%2014.5037Z&#x27;%20fill=&#x27;var(--fill-0,%20%2334C759)&#x27;/%3e%3c/g%3e%3c/svg%3e" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="_icon_vfnfj_61"/><p class="_rowText_vfnfj_67">Clarity on where the money goes, every day.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="_cta_todz0_1" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="_bg_4ahhf_2 " aria-hidden="true"><div class="_frame_4ahhf_14"><div id="vidalytics_embed_1z0e7116xAMOLtq6" class="_embed_4ahhf_25"></div></div></div><div class="_overlay_todz0_22" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="_content_todz0_29"><h2 class="_title_todz0_41">Hire Fin for your business</h2><a class="_button_c0i59_1 _lg_c0i59_42 _solid_c0i59_30 " href="https://wa.me/5511952134536?text=Oi%2C%20tudo%20bem%3F%20Vi%20a%20Squad%20no%20site%20e%20queria%20entender%20como%20os%20agentes%20podem%20ajudar%20o%20meu%20neg%C3%B3cio" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Hire Fin<span class="_arrow_c0i59_69" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"><path d="M3 9h11M10 4.5L14.5 9 10 13.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span></a></div></section><section class="_section_1sih9_1" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><h2 class="_title_1sih9_10">Frequently<br/>asked questions</h2><div class="_list_1sih9_21"><div class="_item_1sih9_29"><button type="button" class="_question_1sih9_35 _questionOpen_1sih9_55" aria-expanded="true"><span>Does Fin replace my accountant?</span><svg class="_chevron_1sih9_59 _chevronOpen_1sih9_69" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><div class="_answerWrap_1sih9_74 _answerOpen_1sih9_80"><p class="_answer_1sih9_74">Fin doesn’t replace your accountant. It organizes the day-to-day finances that today live scattered across spreadsheets and loose notes. It shows how much comes in, how much goes out, and forecasts cash for the coming months, so you can decide with more clarity. The accounting and tax side stays with the professional who already handles it.</p></div></div><div class="_item_1sih9_29"><button type="button" class="_question_1sih9_35 " aria-expanded="false"><span>How does Fin calculate next month’s forecast?</span><svg class="_chevron_1sih9_59 " width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><div class="_answerWrap_1sih9_74 "><p class="_answer_1sih9_74">Fin forecasts cash from your history of money in and out and from the bills already scheduled: expected receipts, fixed expenses, and installments coming due. That way you see ahead of time how much should be left next month.</p></div></div><div class="_item_1sih9_29"><button type="button" class="_question_1sih9_35 " aria-expanded="false"><span>Is my financial data safe with Fin?</span><svg class="_chevron_1sih9_59 " width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><div class="_answerWrap_1sih9_74 "><p class="_answer_1sih9_74">Yes. Your financial data stays protected inside Squad, with access restricted to your company. Fin uses that information only to organize and forecast your cash flow.</p></div></div><div class="_item_1sih9_29"><button type="button" class="_question_1sih9_35 " aria-expanded="false"><span>Does Fin issue invoices?</span><svg class="_chevron_1sih9_59 " width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><div class="_answerWrap_1sih9_74 "><p class="_answer_1sih9_74">Invoice issuing is coming to Fin. The idea is to issue them right in the platform, with no jumping to another system, keeping issuing integrated with the rest of your business’s finances.</p></div></div></div></section></main><footer class="_footer_1un9y_1"><div class="_card_1un9y_34"><div class="_columns_1un9y_49"><nav class="_column_1un9y_49" aria-label="Support"><p class="_columnTitle_1un9y_61">Support</p><ul class="_linkList_1un9y_69"><li><a href="/terms/index.html" class="_link_1un9y_69">Terms of Service</a></li><li><a href="/privacy/index.html" class="_link_1un9y_69">Privacy Policy</a></li><li><a href="https://wa.me/5511952134536?text=Oi%2C%20tudo%20bem%3F%20Vi%20a%20Squad%20no%20site%20e%20queria%20entender%20como%20os%20agentes%20podem%20ajudar%20o%20meu%20neg%C3%B3cio" class="_link_1un9y_69" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Contact</a></li></ul></nav><nav class="_column_1un9y_49" aria-label="Social"><p class="_columnTitle_1un9y_61">Social</p><ul class="_linkList_1un9y_69"><li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/squadcom_br/" class="_link_1un9y_69" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram</a></li><li><a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@squadcom_br?_r=1&amp;_t=ZS-97q74pQJjLF" class="_link_1un9y_69" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tiktok</a></li><li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/innerai/posts/?feedView=all" class="_link_1un9y_69" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a></li></ul></nav><nav class="_column_1un9y_49" aria-label="Download"><p class="_columnTitle_1un9y_61">Download</p><ul class="_linkList_1un9y_69"><li><a href="/download" class="_lin